[B]Release 1.4.3 (ID 1040370)[/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]XenForo 2.3 Asset Resolution[/B]: Moved all core JavaScript files into the add-on's [I]_files[/I] directory and updated build configurations to leverage XenForo 2.3 native asset loading and minification.
[*][B]Template Modernization[/B]: Refactored admin templates ([I]cv6_assetupload.html[/I], [I]cv6_fa_icon.html[/I], [I]cv6_style_fa_icon.html[/I]) to use native [I]<xf:js>[/I] tags resolving directly from the add-on resources.
[*][B]Setup Sync Helper[/B]: Added a new helper method [I]syncGroupPhrases[/I] to [I]SetupTrait.php[/I] to simplify and automate phrase synchronization from group tables during installations or upgrades.
[/LIST]
